==Trivia==
*The name Raynard quite literally means "fox" in French, but the "ay" replacing the "e".
**Raynard may also be a reference to [[wikipedia:Reynard the Fox|Reynard the Fox]].
*His Japanese name, Gonbei, is a portmanteau of ''Gon'', as in [[wikipedia:Gon, the Little Fox|''Gon, the Little Fox'']], and ''Donbei'', as in [https://www.nissinfoods.com.hk/eng/products/nissin-donbei/nissin-donbei-kitsune-udon Nissin Donbei Kitsune Udon] (''kitsune'' means "fox").
*There is an error in Raynard's English description, stating that he used a [[Wave Attack]] instead of a [[Surge Attack]] when he accidentally hit [[Pigge]]. This is likely a mistranslation resulting from how Surge Attack's Japanese name (烈波 ''Reppa'') translates to "Intense Wave".

